		<title>Cedar Creek Quarter Beast</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/valley-view-farms-quarter-beast/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/valley-view-farms-quarter-beast/#respond</comments>
		
