		<pubDate>Fri, 05 Apr 2024 02:22:06 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=3234</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>&#160;</p>
<p><strong>Pack Contents</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Top side Roast</li>
<li>Silverside</li>
<li>Sausages</li>
<li>A Grade Mince</li>
<li>Beef ribs</li>
<li>Brisket</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Plus a variety of steaks including </strong></p>
<ul>
<li>t bone</li>
<li>Y bone</li>
<li>Rib fillet</li>
<li>Osso Bucco</li>
<li>Rump</li>
<li>Round</li>
<li>Diced Steak.</li>
<li>Please also indicate your order preferences ⁃ thick, thin or mixed sausages ⁃ Fresh or Corned silverside</li>
</ul>
<p>Bones and Trim are also optional but its counted as final weight  - This is Based on Dressed Weight</p>
